1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,310
Have you ever sent a message and noticed you

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:06,470
stayed anxious until you received a reply?

3
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:08,590
And then felt silly for reacting that way?

4
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:11,757
This is the third video in which I explain

5
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:13,190
anxious attachment.

6
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:16,432
In the first two, I explained the pattern of

7
00:00:16,432 --> 00:00:18,790
deleting and rereading a message

8
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,884
or staying trapped for days in an argument

9
00:00:20,884 --> 00:00:22,030
that has already ended.

10
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:26,390
Both have the same root cause: your calm is outside you.

11
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,714
It depends on a reply, a tone or an

12
00:00:28,714 --> 00:00:31,990
‘everything is fine’ that must come from someone else.

13
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,375
And this is the part I do not want you to

14
00:00:34,375 --> 00:00:35,190
misunderstand.

15
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:38,090
There is nothing wrong with wanting and loving someone.

16
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:41,849
Wanting is beautiful. The problem is when your

17
00:00:41,849 --> 00:00:44,790
peace lives in someone else's hands.

18
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:47,906
While it stays there, every delay becomes a

19
00:00:47,906 --> 00:00:49,790
threat, almost a sentence.

20
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:53,590
And that is very hard on your body and nervous system.

21
00:00:53,590 --> 00:00:56,687
It affects your sleep, your eating, your

22
00:00:56,687 --> 00:00:58,390
routine and your work.

23
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,190
The work I do will not make you love or want someone less.

24
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:06,526
It returns your peace and calm to the place

25
00:01:06,526 --> 00:01:07,690
they came from.

26
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:09,949
And we have to work on that at the root, in

27
00:01:09,949 --> 00:01:10,790
the unconscious,

28
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:13,717
not through willpower and forcing yourself not

29
00:01:13,717 --> 00:01:14,990
to check your phone.

30
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:17,890
I recorded a full video about this on YouTube,

31
00:01:17,890 --> 00:01:21,490
explaining where it comes from, how the pattern forms

32
00:01:21,490 --> 00:01:25,090
and what we can do to support change in the unconscious.

33
00:01:25,090 --> 00:01:26,990
The link is in my bio.

34
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:29,639
If you recognised yourself in all of this,

35
00:01:29,639 --> 00:01:31,090
make sure you watch it.

36
00:01:31,090 --> 00:01:33,590
And send this to the person you know

37
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:36,464
who holds her breath with anxiety after

38
00:01:36,464 --> 00:01:37,790
sending a message.

